{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:29e347a5907048937b6bbf07d234de78a8433ab57d10753f72c443ee308df73d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb24099496e038688ad9ff780262b7c36110fd6783b82ba9701ef257e300e69",
      "text": "太好了。是最后一本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:988361cc895faf4cf388fa89cc26f30fafd8b6057a57a409faa36fade66216fb",
      "text": "（咦？那本杂志是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f99f5839f61879519cf57bd6371741b4eff7acf3167062616ff4837e1c03bd",
      "text": "恭二先生。您刚才买的，\n是刊登了Beit报道的杂志对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1aa6b477bcdf1328940da7dc29b825b740b51594178496d9c4e9d14a429658e",
      "text": "我记得前几天，好像已经\n把样刊交给您了才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813aa2a0c79d9d28638eac79c45b9627742fd1bcfd9453329910ac2bc425fc4b",
      "text": "是那样没错……但其实啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c16030e6da98d34422bedb505a4f156490fae58538939929beb55d3c2d8df32f",
      "text": "这本杂志，我想拿去给爷爷和奶奶\n也看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91446bee4e2864aab4d9e09b84a254f2c4dc7a61f9173886d763fcb151e928d9",
      "text": "……从我离家出走之后，\n让两个人操了不少心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41be5e506799262a50e0137fbae59b5782d1975361879c3fec7fe772f1304f49",
      "text": "我想把工作成果和自己现在过得很好这件事，\n一起告诉他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ebe39ec449aac32c9da300f91458207a768542cf1ecd36d1b0287933858deac",
      "text": "您非常珍视两位老人家呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e04ba47ad21444c3b91b9d3484e03114b2b355f082b8802d799e9fedd1b81102",
      "text": "还行吧。\n……我偶尔会去看望那两个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cccb84c86c1597cc675abac379b59b3c6caded6ca9c26eb668175b0634cb0c0",
      "text": "我也跟他们聊起过制作人哦。说是托你和\nBeit的福，我才能像这样做好偶像工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d938d993f633055f74721b2b34d0bd5d52663d146d8f967694f47cee63916847",
      "text": "拿着这本杂志，很期待久违地去见他们呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
